U.S. Food Safety Oversight Gaps
--------------------------------
[Regulatory Fragmentation]
    FDA ----X---- USDA
    (split by product, not risk)

[Inspection Gap]
    USDA: Daily
    FDA: Years apart

[Traceability Gap]
    Farm -> Processor -> Distributor -> Retail
    ---- Missing links, non-standard data ----

[Recall Gap]
    Voluntary compliance dominates
    Slow + negotiated scope

[Data Integration Gap]
    FDA | USDA | CDC | States
    ---- siloed systems ----

[Import Oversight Gap]
    <1% physical inspection
    High-risk categories under-sampled

[Chemical Regulation Gap]
    PFAS, metals, additives
    ---- guidance > enforceable limits ----

[Resource Gap]
    Underfunded + understaffed
